<title>HONG KONG: Salomon sets warrants on New World Dev.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets warrants on New World Dev.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc said it intended to issue 50 million call warrants on shares of New World Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$51.0625</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.075</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  07.JAN.98</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> LISTING DATE	30.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  WITH ISSUER'S CASH OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
